{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the matching jungle of Fit My Cat's wild and wacky animal edition!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: your Zoo pals have embarked on a lavish holiday retreat to an exclusive hotel with a sprawling pool oasis, just for them. But there's a snag \u2013 they're all vying for space on a colossal floatie, and they need your finesse to make it work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level unveils a menagerie of creatures, each itching for a spot to lounge and unwind on the floatie. Get ready to mingle with 28 different breeds, from slinky snakes to cuddly pandas, regal lions to quirky capybaras, and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Here's what makes this ZOOOOOish escapade roar to life:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 levels of floaties ready to be filled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 different animals with different shapes and sized</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979130?t=1759737640","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979130/946fcc4482897b810a7b0636b4e1ac2aac16db8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759737640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979130/cac0f7d525b0a381ad45831178545e8ab0266cb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759737640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979130/cac0f7d525b0a381ad45831178545e8ab0266cb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759737640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors"